                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The vault lifter's rotor is activated</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The lifter Flies up to three times its Fly Speed in a straight line without triggering reactions. At the end of this flight, the lifter must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:40] saving throw. On a failure, the lifter's rotor is deactivated.</p>"
